<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Trusting in His mighty power,</l><l>I would cease from all my strife—</l><l>‘Tis not I but He who worketh—</l><l>As I rest and reign in life.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Law of life in Christ has freed me</l><l>From the law of sin and death,</l><l>As I walk in Christ, in spirit,</l><l>Living out God’s Righteousness.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>As the law, He’s now dispensing</l><l>To my being tripartite</l><l>He Himself as life eternal,</l><l>Making me a man of life.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Into Christ’s own glorious image,</l><l>Now this law is shaping me.</l><l>Christ, the Prototype, God’s Firstborn,</l><l>Will be reproduced in me.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Inner law will constitute me</l><l>Member of Christ Body true</l><l>And develop all my function</l><l>By divine capacity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
